# Wave T34 (Highbranch kit): canopyfloor — Highbranch's registered
# street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix;
# the desire-path tiers key on it). LASHED-PLANK WALKWAY:
# sun-bleached VERTICAL planks bound by two horizontal
# rope-lashing bands and flecked with fallen leaves. Orientation,
# lashings and leaf litter make it structurally unlike the
# shipped boardwalk (horizontal planks, plain seams — kept in
# the south as the Long Walkway), Mistford's long horizontal
# timber planks, Beacon's bolted decking and Tidewall's
# driftwood. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T34-HIGHBRANCH-PLAN.md.)
